src/mc6809/ (vendored, unmodified)
  Origin: https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Vectrex_MiSTer , commit 33a82999e2ffaede20e50693db469bf9b0f57705 (2026-11-04), rtl/mc6809is.v, fetched 2026-11-11.
  This is Greg Miller's cycle-accurate MC6809 (https://github.com/cavnex/mc6809 , commit 17e94a6ef163be8b79a9b15b2e814847b6062f0f) in Sorgelig's synchronous
  form with Videodr0me's fixes (NMI arming, reset interrupt state, SEX flags). Copyright (c) 2016, Greg Miller.
  Licence: the author offers the stock BSD 3-clause licence for source redistribution (documentation/LICENSE.md of his repository, copied here as
  src/mc6809/LICENSE.md); the source header names no licence text itself. We take the BSD option. Not GPL: the Vectrex repository's own files are, this one is not.
  Used by trx/pet_core.v for the SuperPET's 6809 (ports used: CLK, fallE_en, fallQ_en, D, DOut, ADDR, RnW, nIRQ, nFIRQ, nNMI, nRESET).
